        "Abstract": "This paper presents X-stance, a multilingual dataset for stance detection on political issues in Switzerland. The dataset contains comments from candidates of elections in Switzerland, annotated with their stance towards a target entity. The dataset is multilingual, covering German, French, and Italian. We use the dataset to train a single model on all the issues and evaluate its performance on zero-shot cross-lingual and cross-target transfer."
